    "message": "Merge concurrent Main specification guard into the research review branch\n\nPreserve both ordered histories and Main's current specification preflight without reverting either candidate. Regenerate the three integrity indexes against the exact Main manifest plus the complete research payload, retaining the two original branch records. Expose the already generated native real-energy receipt in the existing job log as well as its original artifact; this enables admitted byte-level proof readback without another download executor. The predecessor manuscript run 41616011235 succeeded on 7a67d924; this successor still requires its own fresh native gates.",
